<title>UK: Credit Local to launch jumbo dollar bond - Nomura.</title>
<headline>Credit Local to launch jumbo dollar bond - Nomura.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Local de France will launch a jumbo dollar bond in the near future, Nomura International said on Friday as lead manager, having been awarded the mandate.  </p>
<p>No other terms were immediately available.</p>
<p>Credit Local last issued in dollars in November when it set a $100 million five-year at an 11 basis points spread over U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>Prior to that, it launched a $300 million five-year last May at a 20 b.p. spread.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
